# Local, per-machine state. Never shared.
.last-seen/*
!.last-seen/README.md

# Expertise files are personal. They are dropped in by their author and
# committed only in a business's own private repo, never in the template.
# Remove the next line in your business repo if you want them committed there.
context/expertise/*.md
!context/expertise/README.md

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
